OL,3,GNEWSATime capsule preserves manor house
OL,4,Amemories
OL,5,
OL,6,FWedding photographs, coins and copies
OL,7,Fof a local newspaper have all been
OL,8,Fstashed inside a time capsule to be
OL,9,Fembedded in the roof of one of West
OL,10,FYorkshire's oldest houses.
OL,12,FIlkley Manor House was built in about
OL,13,F1390 on the site of a Roman fort, and
OL,14,Fis now run by a charity as a local
OL,15,Fheritage museum, art gallery and
OL,16,Fcommunity venue.
OL,18,FWhen the Grade I listed building's roof
OL,19,Ffell into disrepair, renovations began
OL,20,Fand trustees of the site decided to
OL,21,Fcreate a time capsule to show future
OL,22,Fgenerations what life was like in 2026.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
