OL,3,GNEWSATime capsule preserves manor house
OL,4,Amemories
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoger Tilbrook, joint chair of Ilkley
OL,7,FManor House Trust, said the stainless
OL,8,Fsteel capsule would be dropped into a
OL,9,Fspace beneath the roof tiles this week.
